OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with patchy
OL,6,Frain at first, turning heavier and
OL,7,Fmore persistent from the southwest
OL,8,Fthrough the morning. Feeling rather
OL,9,Fchilly and unpleasant though
OL,10,Ftemperatures around average for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPatchy rain possible at times
OL,14,Ftonight, with clearer spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping towards dawn, allowing
OL,16,Ftemperatures to dip with a touch of
OL,17,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
