OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FBright start to the week, with
OL,6,Fplenty of long sunny spells available,
OL,7,Fthough feeling chilly. Turning
OL,8,Fcloudier through the afternoon with
OL,9,Frain and strong winds to come into the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FRemaining chilly and unsettled.
OL,14,FBlustery, occasionally heavy showers
OL,15,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday. Further rain
OL,16,Farrives on Thursday with strong winds
OL,17,Freturning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
